{"about_the_game":"\u300aZombie Woods\u300bis a Rogue-like zombie action game. The game has two states: day and night. During the day, we need to find and defeat different bosses to obtain the weapons they drop. At night, we can use pistols or weapons dropped by defeating the boss to destroy zombies, or avoid zombie attacks. During the day, zombies will die automatically. Every day at dawn, we get a choice of an automatic weapon. Over time, the variety and number of zombies we encounter will increase. Please collect as many weapons as possible during the day to survive the night smoothly.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778770/extras/battle.gif?t=1708866315\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2778770?t=1708866315","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1708866315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1708866315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1708866315","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"\u300aZombie Woods\u300bis a Rogue-like zombie action game. The game has two states: day and night. During the day, we need to find and defeat different bosses to obtain the weapons they drop. At night, we can use pistols or weapons dropped by defeating the boss to destroy zombies, or avoid zombie attacks. During the day, zombies will die automatically. Every day at dawn, we get a choice of an automatic weapon. Over time, the variety and number of zombies we encounter will increase. Please collect as many weapons as possible during the day to survive the night smoothly.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://s